WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.667
Connect the message to a measurable customer journey: lead nurturing.

2
00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:11.684
Use an AI assistant to explore ideas, then choose a specific audience, offer, and experiment.

3
00:00:12.084 --> 00:00:14.652
Define the lifecycle stages in HubSpot.

4
00:00:14.652 --> 00:00:19.855
Use ChatGPT to draft different messages for new leads and returning customers.

5
00:00:19.855 --> 00:00:26.177
A useful sequence follows the customer context instead of sending the same message to everyone.

6
00:00:26.577 --> 00:00:30.671
Inspect the landing-page and conversion events in Google Analytics.

7
00:00:30.671 --> 00:00:38.004
Compare the segment response in Looker Studio, then build the review step in n eight n and adapt the creative in Canva.

8
00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:41.639
Bring those signals into customer lifecycle campaign.

9
00:00:41.639 --> 00:00:45.117
Show what changed, what it means, and what to test next.

10
00:00:45.117 --> 00:00:49.084
Creative production and measurement work as one continuous loop.
